        "required": false,
        "default": "\"brand\"",
        "description": "Which family the SELECTED state paints in. `brand` (the default) is the estate's blue selection colour and is right almost everywhere. `success` exists for chips sitting on a surface that has no blue in it — the SAMAVESH banner's saffron/green drawer being the case that asked for it, where a blue pill was a third colour family on a two-family panel. It changes the SELECTED state only; an unselected chip is identical."
